iRz hKEAti pf-24_">Vector Images</span></p><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-25_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-27_">Vector images are composed of points, lines and shapes that can be edited to precise detail. The vector art is clean with crisp lines and ready to be reproduced on almost any product. It can be enlarged or reduced with no quality loss.</span></p><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-28_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-29_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jObWnj dWwBay pf-30_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/vector-art-1660669954703.jpg?v=1660669969" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/vector-art-1660669954703.jpg?v=1660669969 1536w" width="432" height="360"/></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-31_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jObWnj dWwBay pf-32_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/vector-art-frame-1660669954700.jpg?v=1660669964" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/vector-art-frame-1660669954700.jpg?v=1660669964 1536w" width="432" height="360"/></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-33_"></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-34_"></div></div></div><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-35_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-37_">Raster Images</span></p><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-38_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-40_">Raster images are made up of pixels which are small dots of